---
import type { ArchiveRecord } from '../lib/onmam';
import videoSources from '../data/video-source-links.json';
interface Props { record: ArchiveRecord }
const {record}=Astro.props;
const source=videoSources[record.key as keyof typeof videoSources];
---
{source && <aside class="video-sources" aria-label="원본 영상 연결">
  <h2>영상 보기</h2>
  {source.savedVideoLinks.length>0 && <div class="source-buttons">{source.savedVideoLinks.map(file=><a href={file.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{file.label} ↗</a>)}</div>}
  {source.bandPosts.length>0 ? <>
    <p>아래 버튼을 누르면 영상이 올라온 Band 원본 게시글이 열립니다.</p>
    <div class="source-buttons">{source.bandPosts.map((url,index)=><a href={url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Band에서 영상 보기{source.bandPosts.length>1?' '+(index+1):''} ↗</a>)}</div>
    <small>Band 로그인 또는 해당 밴드 가입이 필요할 수 있습니다.</small>
  </> : <><p>기존 게시글에서 영상의 원본 연결을 확인할 수 있습니다.</p><a href={source.onmamPost} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">기존 게시글 열기 ↗</a></>}
</aside>}
<div class="original-content" data-record-body={record.key} set:html={record.html} />
<div data-record-media={record.key}></div>
{record.embeds.map(url => <div class="video-player"><iframe src={url} title={record.title+' 영상'} loading="lazy" allow="encrypted-media; picture-in-picture; fullscreen" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen /></div>)}
{record.files.length>0 && <section class="attachments" aria-label="첨부파일"><h2>첨부파일</h2><ul>{record.files.map(file => <li>{file.url ? <a href={file.url} download={file.name}>{file.name} <span>내려받기 ↓</span></a> : <span>{file.name} · 원본 확인 필요</span>}</li>)}</ul></section>}
{record.unavailableFiles>0 && <p class="unavailable">일부 사진 또는 영상은 기존 사이트의 원본 파일을 확인해야 합니다.</p>}
<style>
  .video-sources{margin:0 0 1.8rem;padding:1.4rem;border:1px solid #d9e6de;border-left:4px solid #39714d;border-radius:6px;background:#f5f9f5}.video-sources h2{font-size:1.2rem;color:#244e35;margin-bottom:.5rem}.video-sources p{font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.7;color:#456052}.source-buttons{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.6rem;margin:.9rem 0}.video-sources a{display:inline-block;padding:.7rem 1rem;background:#346d49;color:#fff;border-radius:5px;font-weight:600}.video-sources small{display:block;font-size:.82rem;color:#63746a}
  .original-content{line-height:1.9;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-size:1rem;color:#344054;overflow-x:auto}
  .original-content :global(p){margin:.7rem 0;min-height:.4em}
  .original-content :global(img){display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:1rem auto;border-radius:4px}
  .original-content :global(video),.original-content :global(audio){display:block;max-width:100%;margin:1.5rem auto}
  .original-content :global(table){border-collapse:collapse;max-width:100%;width:100%;margin:1.5rem 0}
  .original-content :global(td),.original-content :global(th){padding:.7rem;border:1px solid #d7dfeb;vertical-align:top}
  .original-content :global(a){color:#1a4fa0;text-decoration:underline}
  .original-content :global(ul),.original-content :global(ol){padding-left:1.5rem}
  .original-content :global(blockquote){padding:1rem 1.4rem;border-left:3px solid #1a4fa0;background:#f4f7fc;margin:1rem 0}
  .original-content :global(h1),.original-content :global(h2),.original-content :global(h3){margin:1.4rem 0 .7rem;line-height:1.5}
  .video-player{margin:2rem 0;aspect-ratio:16/9}.video-player iframe{width:100%;height:100%;border:0;border-radius:8px}
  .attachments{margin-top:2rem;padding:1.25rem;background:#f5f7fb;border-radius:8px}.attachments h2{font-size:1rem;margin-bottom:.5rem}.attachments ul{list-style:none}.attachments li{padding:.5rem 0}.attachments a{color:#1a4fa0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.attachments span{font-size:.85rem}
  .unavailable{margin-top:1rem;padding:1rem;background:#fff8e7;color:#765218;font-size:.9rem}
</style>
